.svg","name":"Tentacle Stab","sort":900000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per round</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The quoppopak makes two tentacle Strikes against the same creature. These Strikes deal piercing damage instead of bludgeoning, and the quoppopak can't @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.Tkd8sH4pwFIPzqTr]{Grab} with them. Its multiple attack penalty doesn't increase until after both attacks.</p>"},"frequency":{"max":1,"per":"round","value":1},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[{"domain":"damage","key":"RollOption","option":"tentacle-stab","toggleable":true},{"key":"DamageDice","override":{"damageType":"piercing"},"predicate":["tentacle-stab"],"selector":"tentacle-damage"}],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!iOgw4v4zSrkUokxj.aBhOPuUKmVRdyDaq"},{"_id":"MpVGiSQqFNp5G6Ig","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Water Glide","sort":1000000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>The quoppopak can stand and move on the surface of water or other liquids without falling through. It can go underwater if it wishes, but it must @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.c8TGiZ48ygoSPofx]{Swim} to do so.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!iOgw4v4zSrkUokxj.MpVGiSQqFNp5G6Ig"},{"_id":"gPcEpmaBWg5HI19y","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","